{
  "$comment": [
    "The libraries inside rooster's native bundles, with the upstream source of every vendored licence file.",
    "fetch.mjs downloads the files (`node scripts/licenses/native/fetch.mjs [--verify]`); scripts/third-party-notices.mjs renders them.",
    "`version` is what the bundle ships. `ref` is the revision the files were taken from: the shipped one, or the nearest one with `nearest` saying why.",
    "`lines` takes those lines (1-based, inclusive; several ranges are joined by a `[...]` line) of a source file whose header comment is the notice. `standard` names texts in scripts/licenses/ that apply as well.",
    "A sharp-libvips library's `key` is its name in the package's versions.json; the notices generator checks the versions against the installed package."
  ],
  "bundles": {
    "bun": {
      "version": "1.4.3",
      "pins": "https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/tree/bun-v1.4.3/scripts/build/deps"
    },
    "sharp-libvips": {
      "version": "1.3.4",
      "pins": "https://github.com/lovell/sharp-libvips/blob/v1.3.4/versions.properties"
    }
  },
  "polyfills": {
    "bundle": "bun",
    "lockfile": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oven-sh/bun/bun-v1.4.3/src/node-fallbacks/bun.lock",
